where \(c_{0,1,2,3}\) are the parameters. To characterize the proton/antiproton efficiency two different functions are implemented. For saturating efficiency in pp and dAucollisions a similar form can be used as for kaons.To account for the small decrease in the proton/antiproton efficiency a simple linear combination of the previous functions can be used in mid-central and central Au-Au collisions. Table 6.2, Tab. 6.3 and Tab. 6.4 show a representative set of the extracted parameters.

