## 7 Results and discussion

In this section we present the transverse momentum spectra of the invariant yield \(\left(\frac{1}{2\pi p_{T}}\frac{dN}{dydp_{T}}\right)\) for identified charged particles: \(\pi^{\pm}\), \(K^{\pm}\), p and \(\bar{p}\) in 200 GeV pp, 200 GeV dAu and in 62.4 GeV Au-Au collisions. Their \(\langle p_{T}\rangle\), dN/dy, and particle ratios are studied. Bulk properties extracted from chemical and kinetic model fit results are discussed.

